WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.475 --> 00:00:03.150
Nobody knows this woman's name.

2
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:12.775
In nineteen forty-one someone in San Francisco pointed a home movie camera down a street, and she walked through it.

3
00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:19.575
She is in a buttoned coat, with one arm out, waving strangers across the road.

4
00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:25.050
She has no idea this is the part of her day that will last.

5
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:31.750
Whatever worried her that morning is gone now, along with everyone who knew about it.

6
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.300
The cars she held back are gone.

7
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.950
So is the crowd.

8
00:00:38.925 --> 00:00:42.425
Eighty-five years later, her arm is still out.

9
00:00:43.425 --> 00:00:44.625
Go on.

10
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.175
You can cross.
